OL,3,GNEWSACarrie Mullane body 'kept in van
OL,4,Afor two weeks' before being moved to
OL,5,Alough
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman was beaten to death and her
OL,8,Fbody kept in a van for two weeks before
OL,9,Fit was placed in Lough Erne, a court
OL,10,Fheard on Thursday.
OL,12,FThe detail emerged as a nephew of the
OL,13,Fman charged with the murder of Carrie
OL,14,FMullane appeared in court in connection
OL,15,Fto her death.
OL,17,FThe 39-year-old from Limerick went
OL,18,Fmissing in Enniskillen, County
OL,19,FFermanagh, on 10 October. A body was
OL,20,Frecovered from the lough on 9 November
OL,21,Fand a formal identification process is
OL,22,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
