OL,3,GNEWSACarrie Mullane body 'kept in van
OL,4,Afor two weeks' before being moved to
OL,5,Alough
OL,6,
OL,7,FKenneth Lynch, 31, from Trasna Park in
OL,8,FEnniskillen, appeared at Strabane
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court via videolink
OL,10,Fcharged with withholding information
OL,11,Fand encouraging or assisting in the
OL,12,Fcommission of an offence, namely
OL,13,Fmurder.
